# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: The Brassbolts Brothers (2769), ... and Bugs (1258).
# Left out (0.4.3): Cortello's Riddle (624, 625, 626): its scroll lies on the Bloodsail ships south of Booty Bay among
# crews of 42-45, three to five levels over players here at about 40, and its later parts lead to Bloodfen Burrow in
# Dustwallow Marsh and the far east of the Hinterlands, where the route doesn't go for them.
# Hostile Takeover (213, 0.4.3): taken from Kebok on the first Booty Bay stop, its Tumbled Crystals from the Geologists
# at Lake Nazferiti on the ride from Kurzen's Compound to Zul'Mamwe (Venture Co. Agents 39, at about 41), handed in
# with Kebok's trolls on the last Booty Bay stop; on 30-40/04b the Agents were three over players at about 35.7.
# Since 2026-11-07 The Black Shield (1253, 1319, 1320) and Suspicious Hoofprints (1284) are done on the Theramore
# crossing at 33-34 (30-40/03).
# The Bloodsail Buccaneers (608) is taken on the level-48 Booty Bay stop (40-50/05), and since 0.4.3 so are Akiris by
# the Bundle (617), Zanzil's Secret (621), Voodoo Dues (609) and The Bloodsail Buccaneers (604), which are done there:
# taken here at 40 and carried through the Riverglades they held its quest log at 36.
# Left out: A Meal Served Cold (212): its 30-minute limit can't last from Stormwind to the
# Cold Eye Basilisks and back.
# Level tidy (0.4.0): Panther Mastery (192, Shadowmaw Panthers 37-38) and Troll Witchery (205, the Skullsplitter Mystics'
# fetishes, 39-40) are worked here at about 41, between the Jungle Stalkers and the north-west coast, and handed in at
# Nesingwary's camp and the Rebel Camp on the same ride north; they were three and four levels over players on the 30-40
# Stranglethorn loops, which give them (30-40/04 and 04b) for this visit. Tiger Mastery's Sin'Dall (188, level 37), on
# the hilltop south-west of Nesingwary's camp, is killed on the ride from the north-west coast to the camp (fix round 2:
# players reached her at about 35.5 on 04b).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Theramore

