step Kurzen's Compound
  tip East from the Rebel Camp to Kurzen's Compound: Wendel Mathers is caged at its western edge. The Kurzen Subchiefs (35-36) and Elites (36-37) carry his cage key; the fighter's uniform lies in a supply crate in the compound's eastern part.
  tip Careful: Colonel Kurzen, an elite of 39-40, stands at the compound's north end beside three of the Subchiefs: take the key from the Subchiefs and Elites further south and leave him be.
  accept 97047 @44.3,7.9 map 1434     -- Wendel Mathers, in his cage, if you didn't take it on the 30-40 loop
  collect 216616 quest 97047          -- Compound Cage Key, from the Subchiefs (or the Elites)
  collect 216617 quest 97047 @49.6,7.7 map 1434 -- Kurzen Fighter's Uniform, in the supply crate deep in the cave
  turnin 97047 @44.3,7.9 map 1434     -- Wendel Mathers, back at his cage on the way out
  accept 97048                        -- For Captain Aransas in Booty Bay, at the end of the jungle loop

step Lake Nazferiti
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip South from the compound to Lake Nazferiti, on the ride to Zul'Mamwe: the Venture Co. Geologists in the camps on its shore carry the Tumbled Crystals, with Venture Co. Agents (39) walking among them. Stealthed Shadowmaw Panthers prowl the jungle south and east of the lake: keep to the shore camps.
  collect 4106 quest 213 @44.5,20.5 map 1434 -- Tumbled Crystal

step Panther Mastery
  when group 193
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Bhag'thera is a level 40 elite: most classes solo it at level 42, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
  collect 3876 quest 193.1 @49.4,24.0 map 1434

step Ruins of Zul'Mamwe: kill these as you meet them
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip The Skullsplitter trolls hold the ruins just east of the mine; any of them can drop tusks, their panthers always do.
  tip Follow the road north-east to the Venture Co. camp at the Crystalvein Mine; the miners, surveyors and foremen drop the crystals.
  tip Careful: Stealthed Shadowmaw Panthers and Stranglethorn Tigresses roam the area around the camp.
  collect 1524 quest 209.1 @45.4,36.2 map 1434 era -- Skullsplitter Tusk, from the trolls of the ruins
  collect 3917 quest 600              -- Singing Blue Crystal

